title: The Senate Under Siege
subtitle: How will the Caucus meet the Sith Lord's move?
tags: event
view-if: finale and gambit and finale_day >= 2 and not gambit_response_seen
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: gambit_response_seen = 1; gambit_bonus = 0

= The Senate Under Siege

[? if gambit_kind = "exposed" : Exposed, Palpatine has abandoned all pretence. ?][? if gambit_kind = "decree" : The Chancellor's decree is hours old. ?][? if gambit_kind = "coup" : The coup is under way. ?] Loyal and disloyal forces are moving all over Coruscant. The Caucus has time for one great effort.

- @senate: Rally the Senate to stand together.
- @jedi: Call on the Jedi Order.
- @pact: Mobilise the Defence Pact.
- @army: Appeal directly to the army and the Navy.

@senate
subtitle: [? if senate_resolve >= 3 : The Senate has the resolve to stand. ?][? if senate_resolve < 3 : The Senate may not have the nerve. ?]
on-arrival: gambit_bonus += 2 if senate_resolve >= 3; gambit_bonus += 1 if senate_resolve < 3; gambit_bonus += 1 if delegation_formed; faith += 2

The Caucus calls the Senate into emergency session, and hundreds of senators come, in defiance of the guards at the doors.

@jedi
subtitle: [? if jedi_relation >= 45 : The Jedi will come. ?][? if jedi_relation < 45 : The Jedi may hesitate. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.gambit_bonus += Q.jedi_relation >= 45 ? Q.jedi_strength * 0.35 : Q.jedi_strength * 0.15; Q.senate_jedi_pact = 1; !}

The Jedi march from the Temple to the Senate building, lightsabers lit, to defend the Senate.

@pact
subtitle: [? if pact_formed : The Pact is ready. ?][? if not pact_formed : There is no Pact to call on. ?]
on-arrival: gambit_bonus += member_forces * 0.6 if pact_formed; gambit_bonus += 0.5 if not pact_formed

Defence Pact squadrons jump to Coruscant from Alderaan and Corellia.

@army
view-if: clones > 0
subtitle: [? if chips_removed or army_oversight : The army answers to the Senate as well. ?][? if not chips_removed and not army_oversight : The clones were bred to obey. ?]
on-arrival: navy_loyalty += 15; clone_trust += 2; gambit_bonus += 2 if chips_removed or army_oversight

The Caucus broadcasts the evidence directly to every ship and garrison of the Grand Army.
